tt-local-generator (0.58.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * ui(create): fix the big left gutter — the width cap now flush-LEFT aligns
    (align="start" on MaxWidthBin) instead of centering, so a wide window no
    longer leaves ~240px of empty padding on the left.
  * ui(create): compact form column (~660px) with the result pane filling the
    rest, top-aligned — echoing the release's generation-panel + content layout.
  * fix(create): the seed-image well no longer stretches into a tall vertical
    bar (fixed compact square, valign start) — the "wonky form" is gone.

